  questName: "Yank\u0131 Ta\u015F\u0131"
  hintText: "\"Muhaf\u0131z\u0131n ilk sorusunu duydu\u011Funda sus ve dinle: konu\u015Ftu\u011Fun an kaybolan \u015Fey cevapt\u0131r.\n\u0130kincisinde ise geldi\u011Fin yola d\xF6n ve yere bak: her ad\u0131m\u0131n arkanda ne b\u0131rak\u0131yor?\""
  completionMessage: "Be\u015F par\xE7a birle\u015Fti; ta\u015F sana f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor."
